sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as Eval-Hub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant IdGate as Identity Gate<br/>X-User / X-Tenant
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Job as K8s Batch Job
    participant Init as eval_runtime_init<br/>Init Container
    participant Sidecar as eval_runtime_sidecar<br/>Sidecar Proxy
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2-1.3
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/SQLite

    Note over Client,DB: API Request Flow
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs
    API->>IdGate: Check identity enforcement config
    alt Identity enforcement enabled
        IdGate-->>API: Validate X-User, X-Tenant headers
    else Local/development mode
        IdGate-->>API: Bypass identity check
    end

    Note over Client,DB: Evaluation Job Orchestration
    API->>DB: Persist evaluation record
    DB-->>API: Record ID
    API->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap<br/>(evaluation config)
    K8sAPI-->>API: ConfigMap created
    API->>K8sAPI: Create Secret<br/>(credentials)
    K8sAPI-->>API: Secret created
    API->>K8sAPI: Query HardwareProfile CR<br/>(hardware-aware scheduling)
    K8sAPI-->>API: HardwareProfile spec
    API->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1 Job<br/>(with init + sidecar)
    K8sAPI-->>API: Job created
    API-->>Client: 202 Accepted (Job ID)

    Note over Job,S3: Job Execution
    K8sAPI->>Init: Start init container
    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>AWS SDK / HTTPS
    S3-->>Init: Test data artifacts
    Init-->>Job: Init complete
    K8sAPI->>Job: Start main container
    K8sAPI->>Sidecar: Start sidecar proxy
    Job->>Sidecar: Evaluation requests
    Sidecar-->>Job: Proxied responses

    Note over API,OTel: External Integrations
    API->>MLflow: Track experiment<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2-1.3<br/>Custom CA support
    MLflow-->>API: Experiment metadata
    API->>OTel: Export traces/metrics/logs<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over API,Metrics: Metrics Collection
    Metrics->>Metrics: Serve /metrics on :8081 (cluster)
    API->>API: Serve /metrics on :8080 (local mode)
